    "title": "Hiring Production Engineer at Finolex Cables Holdings Services",
    "description": "Finolex Cables Holdings Services is actively seeking a talented and motivated Production Engineer to join our dynamic team in Kochi. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Finolex Cables Holdings Services:\nFinolex Cables Holdings Services is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n• Implement lean manufacturing and continuous improvement initiatives\n• Implement 5S, Kaizen, and Six Sigma practices on the shop floor\n• Train and supervise shop floor workers and supervisors\n• Conduct root cause analysis for quality rejections and defects\n• Ensure environmental compliance and waste management\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Arch / M.Arch from recognized institution\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in APQP\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n• Proficiency in 5S\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in SolidWorks\n• Proficiency in Statistical Process Control\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Kochi, Kerala, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Finolex Cables Holdings Services!",
